        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-803, Ornate Swirl Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Ornate Swirl Cabinet Pull demonstrates the perfect harmony of design and balance. Neither too gaudy or too over-designed, this curved drop pull will easily add a lovely point of interest to any home. It is available in 3 and 3-1/2 center to centers in 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-803 Ornate Swirl Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: brass</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>CP-803</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/16\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>CP-804</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-crab.jpg?v=1704354546\" width=\"497\" height=\"122\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
